:: Carter Hero's Weakness Part 5 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
The crouch through the hallway goes rather well, with you both keeping low to the ground as you carefully carry the fragile Blockz creation back to the safety of your base. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> points out how extra careful you have to be, explaining that <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“dropping that thing could cause it to go off! Even if it breaks, it may mess with our minds, make us evil for a bit. Something like that happened in the comics once – I mean, I heard about it happening to our superhero friends! So be extra careful!”</span> <br>
<br>
You salute, promising to keep it perfectly safe, <span style="color:Yellow">but the world seems to be in a funny mood as, right as you walk into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s room, you slip on one of his shoes, tossing the device into the air as you manage to catch yourself on his bed!</span> You both watch in slow motion as it flies towards the ground, like some sort of sitcom on TV. You think fast, lunging forward to catch it! You slide across the carpet, barely getting far enough for it to land roughly in your hand! You both sigh in relief, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Good job, that was almost-!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Then it splits in half.</span> <br>

