    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Then I will do what heroes must, and defeat this new evil! Even if it wears the face of my friend!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> proclaims, charging at you again as the battle continues! But you had a trick up your sleeve, <span style="color:Pink">as you remember what <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has said about his powers and where they come from,</span> so as he charges at you, you duck under him and grab the hem of his shirt, yanking it up! The boy spins in surprise, <span style="color:Pink">the top being pulled off as he flops onto his bed!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Woah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries out in surprise. <span style="color:Pink">He looks down at his bare chest, blushing slightly and covering his chest,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why did you-!? Wait-!”</span> <br>

